                        "entry_id": "990bc849-9ba9-386c-b971-b95d056c15d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An asystole; the absence of heart contractions or brain waves.",
                            "The disappearance of the rhythmic peaks displayed on a heart monitor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc9681b7-de08-318c-844a-82cfa26b5be8",
                        "entry_id": "990bc849-9ba9-386c-b971-b95d056c15d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An asystole; the absence of heart contractions or brain waves.",
                            "The disappearance of brain waves on an electroencephalogram."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0440394-911d-48e4-ab5f-70bc0eef3fee",
                                "sense_id": "dc9681b7-de08-318c-844a-82cfa26b5be8",
                                "text": "When brain function ceases, the electroencephalogram shows flatline recordings."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "60d3d6d0-dd50-3d12-8fb7-33c766300384",
                        "entry_id": "990bc849-9ba9-386c-b971-b95d056c15d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unchanging state, as indicated in a graph of a variable over time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "also",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c4358a5-8a9c-40da-bd05-2c9bb87a5ff4",
                                "sense_id": "60d3d6d0-dd50-3d12-8fb7-33c766300384",
                                "text": "Thus, you hear words like \"flatline recession,\" \"improvement at a greatly reduced rate,\" \"economic hiccup,\" \"recessionette,\" \"rolling readjustment\" and \"the economy is double clutching.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db09cb31-c914-3b3d-8e9d-7d9befe6bc8b",
                        "entry_id": "990bc849-9ba9-386c-b971-b95d056c15d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A line that is run low to the water from the rod tip, generally off a release clip of some type."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
